---
/*
  Replaces /story and /team. Governance instead of a founding story.
  04-konzept.md section 4.3, page "/company".
  No team size anywhere on this page until decision 5 is made: four different
  numbers in four places are worse than no number.
  Sprache: einfaches Englisch, Ansage Manuel 07.09.2026 abends.
*/
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../components/CtaBlock.astro';
import { legal } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Company | Wunder"
  description="The company behind Wunder: KG Models SIA in Riga, with two directors in the public register."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>The company behind the name.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Wunder is a brand by {legal.company}. The number in the register is {legal.regNumber}. The
        company started on {legal.registered}. The address is {legal.street}, {legal.city}, {
          legal.country
        }.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can look all of that up in the Latvian register. You do not need us for it. There is a
        company with a like name in the United States. It has nothing to do with us. The number
        above is how you tell them apart.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Who decides.</h2>
      <p>
        Two directors run the company. Each one may sign alone. Both are in the public register.
        Manuel Gonzalez is CEO and co owner. Lauris Kalnins is COO and co owner.
      </p>
      <div class="people">
        <Photo
          file="manuel-gonzalez.webp"
          alt="Manuel Gonzalez smiles while working at a laptop by a window."
          width={900}
          height={675}
          sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 340px"
          ratio="portrait"
          caption="Manuel Gonzalez, CEO and co owner."
        />
        <Photo
          file="lauris-kalnins.webp"
          alt="Lauris Kalnins sits at a desk with a laptop and an open notebook."
          width={900}
          height={1349}
          sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 340px"
          ratio="portrait"
          caption="Lauris Kalnins, COO and co owner."
        />
      </div>
      <p>
        {legal.company} signs your deal. There is no second firm in the chain. There is no middle
        man. Your deal is not passed on to anyone else.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Where the work happens.</h2>
      <p>
        Riga is the seat of the company and the office. Our content and chat team works in the
        Philippine time zone. That is why the chat is awake when your fans are.
      </p>
      <p class="caption">
        We do not publish a team size yet. First we want to count it the same way twice, staff and
        freelancers apart. A number we cannot repeat is worse than no number.
      </p>
      <div class="shots-single">
        <Photo
          file="team-group.webp"
          alt="Eight people from the team stand together and smile."
          width={1400}
          height={787}
          sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 780px"
          caption="Part of the team. Not everyone is in this picture."
        />
      </div>
      <p class="caption">
        These photos are our own. They come from our old website. We use no stock photos and no
        pictures made by a machine.
      </p>
      <CtaBlock secondary />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .people {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .shots-single {
    margin: 32px 0;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .people {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
